An '''antipoison potion''' is a potion that acts as the equivalent to a [[superantipoison]], which cures [[poison]] and provides immunity to it for 6 minutes. It can be made with 75 [[Herblore]] by using a [[noxifer]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having [[cicely]] in the inventory.

This potion is the standard variant of antipoison, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

